Error [E1003]: A `U8` holds 0..255
  --> tests/ui/number_name_module_constant.jet:10:17
    |
 10 |     print(take8(BIG))
    |                 ^^^
  --> tests/ui/number_name_module_constant.jet:6:6
    |
  6 | BIG: 300
    |      ^^^ `BIG` is this number
 Why: Binary APIs use one byte per value
 Fix: Use a number from 0 through 255
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1003
